{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2021-11-01 04:00:00', 'title': 'AERCAP COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF GE CAPITAL AVIATION SERVICES FROM GE', 'text': 'DUBLIN, NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AERCAP HOLDINGS N.V. ("AERCAP") (NYSE: AER), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN AIRCRAFT LEASING, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF THE GE CAPITAL AVIATION SERVICES BUSINESS ("GECAS") FROM GENERAL ELECTRIC (NYSE: GE).'}